Yes. And people who say "we're only 10 minutes from the hospital" are forgetting life-altering facts--indeed, life or death ones:
- Ambulances take time to arrive, and so does getting a laboring woman having a medical emergency out of the house and into a car;
- Arriving at the hospital entrance may take 10 minutes, but it will take at least that much longer (and more likely 15-30 minutes) to get from the entrance into a delivery or operating room;
